# The language page in play (fixtures/langf6: dialkey's save, Twinsen by
# scene 1's message zone 12, and sound's lba.cfg, English voices). F6's
# options, Choose language, the texts in French and the voices off, back
# to the game, where Space opens the zone's message in French and
# silent. The Classic puts back the voices it held off around its
# options, and its message speaks in English until the next start.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 12
shot start
hold 0.05
key F6
sleep 3
shot options
key Down Down Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot page
key Down Right
sleep 3
key Down Left
sleep 3
shot changed
key Up Up Return
sleep 3
key Up Up Up Up Return
sleep 3
shot back
hold 0.15
key space
sleep 6
shot message
hold 0.4
key Shift_L
hold 0.15
sleep 3
shot end
